==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~33.33 seconds<sup>200f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[9th Anniversary Birthday Cake]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Spamming quick units such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] , [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]] can get the stage beaten easily. Bring [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] or other [[Critical Hit|critical hitters]] to finish the stage faster.

